# Harness-generality allowlist — read by crates/marion-testsupport/tests/three_axis (run: scripts/three-axis.sh).
#
# Format: `path:item  one-line reason`. `item` is the enclosing fn/const/impl type, `::`-joined.
# A finding not listed here fails the check; an entry nothing matches fails it too, so a fix
# deletes its line. THIS LIST ONLY SHRINKS: every entry below is debt with a named way out.
#
# Known per-harness code a syntax check cannot see (tracked in the same wave, not listed here
# because nothing here would match it): bin/marion.rs's stream-json frame renderers, doctor's
# `Option<acp::Binding>` paths.

