# --- verified row data, not a branch ------------------------------------------------------------
crates/marion-core/src/agent_type.rs:BUILTINS  row data: the built-in agent-type table, one row per harness type, is the registry itself
crates/marion-core/src/provider.rs:PROVIDERS  row data: provider registry rows name each provider's own key variable
