crates/marion-supervisor/src/provider_check.rs:models_request  `Wire::Gemini` is Google's generativelanguage API wire, a protocol a provider serves (gemini, openrouter …), not the gemini harness; each wire's listing path and key header is a protocol fact — removable if Wire grows a listing-request method
